{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1532204-scion-god-aspect-of-the-apex-predator","id":1532204,"title":"Scion God - Aspect of the Apex Predator","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-03-07T16:13:12-08:00","id":1532204,"title":"Scion God - Aspect of the Apex Predator","content":"Hi all, <br /> <br /> In the Scion God Advance pdf, on page 188 is detailed the Boon Aspect of the Apex Predator. My feeling is that this boon is missing something. It details considerable drawbacks for a scion using it, but presents benefits that do not come even close to offsetting these downsides. Am I missing something, or is part of this boon's writeup MIA?<br /> <br /> Cheers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24183-thevoiceoftreason","name":"thevoiceoftreason","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24183_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-07T16:45:20-08:00","id":1532209,"title":"","content":"The drawback doesn\u2019t seem like something that will come up much as it only comes into play when you destroy a target of equal tier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-08T15:37:50-08:00","id":1532259,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1532204-scion-god-aspect-of-the-apex-predator?p=1532209#post1532209\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The drawback doesn\u2019t seem like something that will come up much as it only comes into play when you destroy a target of equal tier.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, for Gods it might not matter as much. But it will definitely be annoying if you wanted to use the Boon at the Hero tier, where equal enemies are a lot more plentiful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-08T16:41:53-08:00","id":1532264,"title":"","content":"Maybe my Storyguides have be taking it easy, but I don\u2019t think I\u2019ve played a Scion game where there\u2019s been a combat scene with more Tier 2 opponents than the number of Scions in the band. It\u2019s been either one or two equal or higher tier opponents or a single equal or higher tier opponents with multiple either trivial or Tier 1 lackies to deal with. There\u2019s been time where there were more Tier 2 or higher antagonists over the course of a session, but rarely in the same session and never in the same scene. I\u2019ll need to go back and re-read the section, but I don\u2019t think characters who aren\u2019t Tier 4 can take Divine Wounds which seems like the biggest drawback potential drawback to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-10T01:45:08-08:00","id":1532319,"title":"","content":"I'd say you're correct for the most part, however the benefits of the power still don't really track for me, firstly: you may understand the thoughts of animals you can perceive (great, but this seems like a procedural information gathering power, which is not what the flavor text &quot;tearing into Titans' flanks, pursue prey to the ends of the earth&quot; evokes. Secondly you may &quot;consume any number of trivial characters in close range&quot; great again, but this is like, not very useful, as those characters were <b>already </b>trivial, and you could use any, much less risky power to achieve a similar goal. I suppose my complaint is that the incredibly evocative and cool flavor text does not line up with the mechanical benefits I'm reading here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24183-thevoiceoftreason","name":"thevoiceoftreason","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24183_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}